# PART 2: Project File Structure

```
php stuff/
├── index.php       ← The ONLY PHP file. Does everything.
├── tasks.json      ← The "database" file. Stores all tasks.
├── SPEC.md         ← Project specification (requirements doc)
└── css/
    └── styles.css  ← All CSS styles for the UI
```

**Why only one PHP file?** This is called a **Single File Application** pattern. It handles the API (data), the page rendering, and the HTML template all in one place. It's simple to deploy — just copy the folder.

